#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of PulseAudio"
msgstr "Instalação do PulseAudio"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>PulseAudio</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>PulseAudio</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:131
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D database=gdbm    \\\n"
"            -D doxygen=false    \\\n"
"            -D bluez5=disabled  \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D database=gdbm    \\\n"
"            -D doxygen=false    \\\n"
"            -D bluez5=disabled  \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. One test fails if"
" the tests are not run as the root user, but this can be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Um teste "
"falha se os testes não forem executados como o(a) usuário(a) root, mas isso "
"pode ser ignorado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:151
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Running PulseAudio as a system-wide daemon is possible but not recommended. "
"See <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/Documentation/User/SystemWide/\"/>"
" for more information.  While still as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, remove the "
"<application>D-Bus</application> configuration file for the system wide "
"daemon to avoid creating unnecessary system users and groups:"
msgstr ""
"Executar o PulseAudio como um processo de segundo plano abrangente a todo o "
"sistema é possível, mas não recomendado. Veja-se <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/Documentation/User/SystemWide/\"/>"
" para mais informações. Enquanto ainda como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, remova o arquivo de configuração do "
"<application>D-Bus</application> para o processo de segundo plano abrangente"
" a todo o sistema, para evitar criar usuários(as) e grupos de sistema "
"desnecessários(as):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm /usr/share/dbus-1/system.d/pulseaudio-system.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm /usr/share/dbus-1/system.d/pulseaudio-system.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"wireplumber\"/>, make sure to follow "
"the commands to disable the Pulseaudio server to prevent conflicts with "
"Pipewire."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado <xref linkend=\"wireplumber\"/>, certifique-se de "
"seguir os comandos para desabilitar o servidor Pulseaudio para evitar "
"conflitos com Pipewire."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D bluez5=disabled</parameter>: This switch prevents a runtime "
"error if <xref linkend=\"dbus\"/> and <xref linkend=\"sbc\"/> are both "
"installed but <xref linkend=\"bluez\"/> is not installed.  Remove this if "
"you have installed all three packages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D bluez5=disabled</parameter>: Essa chave evita um erro de tempo"
" de execução se <xref linkend=\"dbus\"/> e <xref linkend=\"sbc\"/> estiverem"
" instalados, mas <xref linkend=\"bluez\"/> não estiver instalado. Remova "
"isso se você tiver instalado todos os três pacotes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D doxygen=false</parameter>: This allows the package to compile "
"if <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> is not installed. Remove this if you have "
"installed this and wish to build the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D doxygen=false</parameter>: Isso permite que o pacote compile "
"se <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> não estiver instalado. Remova isso se você "
"tiver instalado isso e desejar construir a documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring PulseAudio"
msgstr "Configurando o PulseAudio"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:207
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are system wide configuration files: "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/daemon.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/client.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/default.pa</filename>, and user configuration files "
"with the same names in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">~/.config/pulse</filename>. User configuration files "
"take precedence over system wide ones."
msgstr ""
"Existem arquivos de configuração abrangentes a todo o sistema: "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/daemon.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/client.conf</filename>, "
"<filename>/etc/pulse/default.pa</filename> e arquivos de configuração de "
"usuário(a) com os mesmos nomes em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">~/.config/pulse</filename>. Os arquivos de configuração "
"de usuário(a) tem precedência sobre os abrangentes a todo o sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/pulse"
msgstr "~/.config/pulse"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/pulse/daemon.conf"
msgstr "/etc/pulse/daemon.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/pulse/client.conf"
msgstr "/etc/pulse/client.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/pulse/default.pa"
msgstr "/etc/pulse/default.pa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You may have to configure the audio system. You can start "
"<application>pulseaudio</application> in command line mode using "
"<command>pulseaudio -C</command> and then list various information and "
"change settings. See <command>man pulse-cli-syntax</command>."
msgstr ""
"Você possivelmente tenha que configurar o sistema de áudio. Você pode "
"iniciar o <application>pulseaudio</application> no modo de linha de comando "
"usando <command>pulseaudio -C</command> e então listar várias informações e "
"mudar as configurações. Veja-se <command>man pulse-cli-syntax</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>pulseaudio</application> was working but you no-longer have "
"sound, after checking for hardware issues (speakers or headphones not "
"connected, external amplifier not connected) you may need to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Se o <application>pulseaudio</application> estava funcionando, mas você não "
"mais tem som, depois de verificar problemas de hardware (alto-falantes ou "
"fones de ouvido não conectados, amplificador externo não conectado), "
"possivelmente precise corrigi-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:264
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One suggestion is to close the application, such as "
"<application>firefox</application> where sound has stopped working, then "
"run: <command>pactl list short sinks</command> followed by: <command>pacmd "
"set-default-sink &lt;sink #&gt;</command> and then restart the application."
msgstr ""
"Uma sugestão é a de fechar o aplicativo, como o "
"<application>firefox</application> onde o som parou de funcionar, e então "
"executar: <command>pactl list short sinks</command> seguido de: "
"<command>pacmd set-default-sink &lt;sink #&gt;</command> e reiniciar o "
"aplicativo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/pulseaudio.xml:272
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If that does not work, a more drastic approach often works. After closing "
"the application, close pulseaudio, either using <command>pulseaudio "
"--kill</command> or, if that fails, <command>killall -KILL "
"pulseaudio</command> and then <command>rm -rf ~/.config/pulse/*</command> "
"(and perhaps also <command>rm -rf ~/.pulse/*</command> if you have used a "
"very old version of pulse on this machine), then run <command>pulseaudio "
"--verbose</command> to restart it. If the daemon starts, restart the "
"application. See <command>man pulseaudio</command> for more options."
msgstr ""
"Se isso não funcionar, uma abordagem mais drástica geralmente funciona. "
"Depois de fechar o aplicativo, feche o pulseaudio, usando "
"<command>pulseaudio --kill</command> ou, se isso falhar, <command>killall "
"-KILL pulseaudio</command> e então <command>rm -rf ~/.config "
"/pulse/*</command> (e talvez também <command>rm -rf ~/.pulse/*</command>, se"
" você tiver usado uma versão muito antiga do pulse nessa máquina), então "
"execute <command>pulseaudio --verbose</command> para reiniciá-lo. Se o "
"processo de segundo plano iniciar, reinicie o aplicativo. Veja-se "
"<command>man pulseaudio</command> para mais opções."

